    {
        "content": "<p>Well, this is not unique to <code>grind</code>, is it? I think most other tactics don't work with <code>Add.add</code>, either (take <code>simp</code>, <code>ring</code> / <code>ring_nf</code>, <code>norm_num</code>, etc.)</p>",
